          },
          "description": "The BrainBots are out of the classroom and heading back in time to learn as much as they can about dinosaurs. In this card Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs explore Pachycephalosaurus – that’s a mouthful!  They’ll see its thick headed skull up close and learn all about how it protects the Pachycephalosaurus brain –  but Nellie is not impressed with how they use it! \n\nTest your knowledge at the end of the card to see how many BrainBank facts you can remember about these amazing creatures."
